            <ArticleTitle>Emergence of sequence type 252 Enterobacter cloacae producing GES-5 carbapenemase in a Czech hospital.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0732-8893(17)30322-X</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.diagmicrobio.2017.10.011</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>ST252 Enterobacter cloacae, producing GES-5 carbapenemase, was isolated in a Czech hospital. blaGES-5 was part of a novel class 1 integron, In1406, which also included a new allele of the aadA15 gene cassette. In1406 was located on a ColE2-like plasmid, pEcl-35771cz (6953bp).</AbstractText>
